Files: src/*
Copyright: 1996-2026 the ReactOS Project and contributors
License: GPL-2.0+
 The bulk of the vendored ReactOS tree (kernel, drivers, DLLs, shell) is
 licensed GPL-2.0-or-later; find the full text in src/COPYING. Newer files
 carry an explicit per-file SPDX LICENSE tag instead - most commonly
 LGPL-2.1-or-later for usermode client libraries and shell components (find
 the full text in src/COPYING.LIB), with a handful of files under
 GPL-3.0-or-later/LGPL-3.0-or-later (src/COPYING3, src/COPYING3.LIB) and a
 BSD-style licence for ARM Portable Systems Group code (src/COPYING.ARM).
 .
 The stanzas below cover the vendored third-party libraries and media
 assets that ship under a different licence than the surrounding
 ReactOS tree.

Files: fonts/ubuntu-font-family-0.83/*
Copyright: 2010-2011 Canonical Ltd
License: Ubuntu-Font-Licence-1.0
 The Ubuntu Font Family is redistributed under the Ubuntu Font Licence
 1.0; the full licence text ships alongside the font in
 fonts/ubuntu-font-family-0.83/LICENCE.txt and in the binary package at
 /usr/share/doc/cdex-base/ubuntu-font/LICENCE.txt.
 At build time the font's GASP table is rewritten (tools/gasp_patch.py)
 so FreeType renders it antialiased at every size. As required by UFL 1.0
 clause 2(c) for Modified Versions, the family is renamed to
 "Ubuntu derivative CusDeb" (tools/rename_font.py).

